  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Furglitch/mc-resourcepack/refs/heads/master/pretty-pretty-pipes/icon.png\" alt=\"Pretty Pretty Pipes 图标\" width=\"96\">\n  </p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><h1>漂亮管道（Pretty Pretty Pipes）</h1></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><h3>为 Pretty Pipes 带来 Pretty Pipez 风格！</h3></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpretty-pretty-pipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/pretty-pretty-pipes?logo=modrinth&amp;color=forestgreen\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pretty-pipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1420405?logo=curseforge&amp;color=orange\">\n  </a>\n</p><p>本资源包将 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pretty Pipez</em></a> 资源包的视觉风格引入 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pretty-pipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pretty Pipes</em></a> 模组。该包修改了管道模型和纹理，同时保持管道内物品的可见性，但<strong>不</strong>包含像 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-x-smart-pipez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pretty X Smart Pipez</em></a> 资源包那样的连接纹理/模型支持。</p><p>也来看看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pretty-pipes-mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>漂亮管道：通用机械版</em></a>吧！</p><hr><h3><strong>支持的模组</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pretty-pipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">漂亮管道（Pretty Pipes）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pretty-pipes-fluids\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">漂亮管道：流体版</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>截图预览</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Furglitch/mc-resourcepack/refs/heads/master/pretty-pretty-pipes/screenshots/preview.png\" alt=\"管道预览\"><br></p><h3><strong>许可协议/来源</strong></h3><p>本资源包使用了来自 <em>Pretty Pipez</em> 包的资源，遵循其 GNUv3 许可协议，并在相同协议下分发。</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.aimeecozza.com%252fhuman-made\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p3WJXsr.png\" height=\"auto\" width=\"64px\" alt=\"100% 人工制作内容\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
